{"id":"n85534-2-8","stage":2,"title":"합하다 · 符合","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85534-2-8-1","ko":"사람은 뽑았어?","zh":"人选选好了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람은","audio":"/audio/987448c10afe56108009.mp3"}},{"text":"뽑았어?","meaning":"选，拣，挑选，选定","explanation":"뽑다：选，拣，挑选，选定；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뽑다","audio":"/audio/8fe05f49afd4379ae870.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26962","senseId":"3","lemma":"뽑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뽑았어","audio":"/audio/8320bc6f14b7ec01ffda.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"8fe05f49afd4379a","term":"뽑다","zh":"选，拣，挑选，选定","audio":"/audio/8fe05f49afd4379ae870.mp3","entryId":"26962","definition":"从多个中挑拣并确定。","pronunciation":["뽑따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3ed904bdfdf5905db95d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85534-2-8-2","ko":"이 일에 합하는 자격을 갖춘 사람을 아직 못 찾았어.","zh":"还没找到具备胜任这项工作资格的人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"表示“人”。","explanation":"이：表示“人”。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71124","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"일에","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일에","audio":"/audio/2